node_modules/
dist/
.env
.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

# UIDAI document-signer certificates are PUBLIC data, published by UIDAI for
# exactly this offline verification, and are deliberately committed. Without one
# on disk every Secure QR scan fails closed (parses, but signatureVerified stays
# false), so shipping them with the code is what keeps a deploy from silently
# degrading to "nothing verifies". Never put a PRIVATE key here.
!apps/api/src/lib/aadhaar/certs/*.cer
